items-center gap-x-2 gap-y-1" data-state="closed"><span class="fern-api-property-key">token</span><span 
class="fern-api-property-meta" data-markdown-ignore=""><span class="fern-api-property-type">string or null</span><span 
class="fern-api-property-optional">Optional</span></span></div><div class="fern-prose prose max-w-none break-words 
text-sm fern-api-property-description text-(color:--grayscale-a11)"><div 
data-fern-style="display:contents"><!--$--><p>A single-use authentication token created via POST 
/v1/single-use-token/batch_scribe. This token can only be used once and expires after 15 minutes. Alternative to API 
key or bearer token authentication for frontend clients.</p><!--/$--></div></div></div><div 
data-orientation="horizontal" role="none" class="shrink-0 h-px w-full bg-border-default"></div><div 
id="request.query.enable_logging" class="relative m-3 space-y-3 mx-0"><div class="inline-flex max-w-full min-w-0 
flex-wrap items-center gap-x-2 gap-y-1" data-state="closed"><span 
class="fern-api-property-key">enable_logging</span><span class="fern-api-property-meta" data-markdown-ignore=""><span 
class="fern-api-property-type">boolean</span><span class="fern-api-property-optional">Optional</span><span 
class="fern-api-property-default">Defaults to <code>true</code></span></span></div><div class="fern-prose prose 
max-w-none break-words text-sm fern-api-property-description text-(color:--grayscale-a11)"><div 
data-fern-style="display:contents"><!--$--><p>When enable_logging is set to false zero retention mode will be used for 
the request. This will mean log and transcript storage features are unavailable for this request. Zero retention mode 
may only be used by enterprise customers.</p><!--/$--></div></div></div></div><div id="request" class="relative 
space-y-3 fern-endpoint-section-request-body"><div class="inline-flex max-w-full min-w-0 flex-wrap items-center 
gap-x-2 gap-y-1" data-state="closed"><h3 class="mt-0">Request</h3></div><div class="fern-prose prose max-w-none 
break-words whitespace-pre-wrap text-sm text-(color:--grayscale-a11)">This endpoint expects a multipart form 
containing an optional file.</div><div data-orientation="horizontal" role="none" class="bg-border-default shrink-0 
h-px w-full"></div><div id="request.body.model_id.model_id" class="relative m-3 space-y-3 mx-0"><div 
class="inline-flex max-w-full min-w-0 flex-wrap items-center gap-x-2 gap-y-1" data-state="closed"><span 
class="fern-api-property-key">model_id</span><span class="fern-api-property-meta" data-markdown-ignore=""><span 
class="fern-api-property-type">string</span><span class="fern-api-property-required 
text-(color:--red-a11)">Required</span></span></div><div class="fern-prose prose max-w-none break-words text-sm 
text-(color:--grayscale-a11)">The ID of the model to use for transcription.</div></div><div 
data-orientation="horizontal" role="none" class="shrink-0 h-px w-full bg-border-default"></div><div 
id="request.body.file.file" class="relative m-3 space-y-3 mx-0"><div class="inline-flex max-w-full min-w-0 flex-wrap 
items-center gap-x-2 gap-y-1" data-state="closed"><span class="fern-api-property-key">file</span><span 
class="fern-api-property-meta" data-markdown-ignore=""><span class="fern-api-property-type">file</span><span 
class="fern-api-property-optional">Optional</span></span></div><div class="fern-prose prose max-w-none break-words 
text-sm text-(color:--grayscale-a11)"><div data-fern-style="display:contents"><!--$--><p>The file to transcribe (100ms 
minimum audio length). All major audio and video formats are supported. Exactly one of the file or cloud_storage_url 
parameters must be provided. The file size must be less than 5.0GB.</p><!--/$--></div></div></div><div 
data-orientation="horizontal" role="none" class="shrink-0 h-px w-full bg-border-default"></div><div 
id="request.body.language_code.language_code" class="relative m-3 space-y-3 mx-0"><div class="inline-flex max-w-full 
min-w-0 flex-wrap items-center gap-x-2 gap-y-1" data-state="closed"><span 
class="fern-api-property-key">language_code</span><span class="fern-api-property-meta" data-markdown-ignore=""><span 
class="fern-api-property-type">string or null</span><span 
class="fern-api-property-optional">Optional</span></span></div><div class="fern-prose prose max-w-none break-words 
text-sm text-(color:--grayscale-a11)"><div data-fern-style="display:contents"><!--$--><p>An ISO-639-1 or ISO-639-3 
language_code corresponding to the language of the audio file. Can sometimes improve transcription performance if 
known beforehand. Defaults to null, in this case the language is predicted 
automatically.</p><!--/$--></div></div></div><div data-orientation="horizontal" role="none" class="shrink-0 h-px 
w-full bg-border-default"></div><div id="request.body.transcript_edit.transcript_edit" class="relative m-3 space-y-3 
mx-0"><div class="inline-flex max-w-full min-w-0 flex-wrap items-center gap-x-2 gap-y-1" data-state="closed"><span 
class="fern-api-property-key">transcript_edit</span><span class="fern-api-property-meta" data-markdown-ignore=""><span 
class="fern-api-property-type">string or null</span><span 
class="fern-api-property-optional">Optional</span></span></div><div class="fern-prose prose max-w-none break-words 
text-sm text-(color:--grayscale-a11)"><div data-fern-style="display:contents"><!--$--><p>Natural-language instruction 
applied to the final transcript (max 2000 characters). The edited text is returned in ‘edited_transcript’ alongside 
the original transcript. Cannot be combined with entity_detection, entity_redaction or use_multi_channel. Usage of 
this parameter will incur an additional 30% surcharge on the base transcription cost, billed for at least 10 seconds 
of audio.</p><!--/$--></div></div></div><div data-orientation="horizontal" role="none" class="shrink-0 h-px w-full 
bg-border-default"></div><div id="request.body.tag_audio_events.tag_audio_events" class="relative m-3 space-y-3 
mx-0"><div class="inline-flex max-w-full min-w-0 flex-wrap items-center gap-x-2 gap-y-1" data-state="closed"><span 
class="fern-api-property-key">tag_audio_events</span><span class="fern-api-property-meta" 
data-markdown-ignore=""><span class="fern-api-property-type">boolean</span><span 
class="fern-api-property-optional">Optional</span><span class="fern-api-property-default">Defaults to 
<code>true</code></span></span></div><div class="fern-prose prose max-w-none break-words text-sm 
text-(color:--grayscale-a11)"><div data-fern-style="display:contents"><!--$--><p>Whether to tag audio events like 
(laughter), (footsteps), etc. in the transcription.</p><!--/$--></div></div></div><div data-orientation="horizontal" 
role="none" class="shrink-0 h-px w-full bg-border-default"></div><div id="request.body.num_speakers.num_speakers" 
class="relative m-3 space-y-3 mx-0"><div class="inline-flex max-w-full min-w-0 flex-wrap items-center gap-x-2 gap-y-1" 
data-state="closed"><span class="fern-api-property-key">num_speakers</span><span class="fern-api-property-meta" 
data-markdown-ignore=""><span class="fern-api-property-type">integer or null</span><span 
class="fern-api-property-optional">Optional</span><code 
class="fern-api-property-constraint">1-32</code></span></div><div class="fern-prose prose max-w-none break-words 
text-sm text-(color:--grayscale-a11)">The maximum amount of speakers talking in the uploaded file. Can help with 
predicting who speaks when. The maximum amount of speakers that can be predicted is 32. Defaults to null, in this case 
the amount of speakers is set to the maximum value the model supports.</div></div><div data-orientation="horizontal" 
role="none" class="shrink-0 h-px w-full bg-border-default"></div><div 
id="request.body.timestamps_granularity.timestamps_granularity" class="relative m-3 space-y-3 mx-0"><div 
class="inline-flex max-w-full min-w-0 flex-wrap items-center gap-x-2 gap-y-1" data-state="closed"><span 
class="fern-api-property-key">timestamps_granularity</span><span class="fern-api-property-meta" 
data-markdown-ignore=""><span class="fern-api-property-type">enum</span><span 
class="fern-api-property-optional">Optional</span><span class="fern-api-property-default">Defaults to 
<code>word</code></span></span></div><div class="fern-prose prose max-w-none break-words text-sm 
text-(color:--grayscale-a11)"><div data-fern-style="display:contents"><!--$--><p>The granularity of the timestamps in 
the transcription. ‘word’ provides word-level timestamps and ‘character’ provides character-level timestamps per 
word.</p><!--/$--></div></div><div class="text-(color:--grayscale-a11) flex items-baseline gap-2"><span 
class="shrink-0 text-sm">Allowed values<!-- -->:</span><span class="inline-flex flex-wrap gap-2"><button 
class="fern-docs-badge small grayscale subtle interactive">none</button><button class="fern-docs-badge small grayscale 
subtle interactive">word</button><button class="fern-docs-badge small grayscale subtle 
interactive">character</button></span></div></div><div data-orientation="horizontal" role="none" class="shrink-0 h-px 
w-full bg-border-default"></div><div id="request.body.diarize.diarize" class="relative m-3 space-y-3 mx-0"><div 
class="inline-flex max-w-full min-w-0 flex-wrap items-center gap-x-2 gap-y-1" data-state="closed"><span 
class="fern-api-property-key">diarize</span><span class="fern-api-property-meta" data-markdown-ignore=""><span 
class="fern-api-property-type">boolean</span><span class="fern-api-property-optional">Optional</span><span 
class="fern-api-property-default">Defaults to <code>false</code></span></span></div><div class="fern-prose prose 
max-w-none break-words text-sm text-(color:--grayscale-a11)">Whether to annotate which speaker is currently talking in 
the uploaded file.</div></div><div data-orientation="horizontal" role="none" class="shrink-0 h-px w-full 
bg-border-default"></div><div id="request.body.diarization_threshold.diarization_threshold" class="relative m-3 
space-y-3 mx-0"><div class="inline-flex max-w-full min-w-0 flex-wrap items-center gap-x-2 gap-y-1" 
data-state="closed"><span class="fern-api-property-key">diarization_threshold</span><span 
class="fern-api-property-meta" data-markdown-ignore=""><span class="fern-api-property-type">double or null</span><span 
class="fern-api-property-optional">Optional</span><code 
class="fern-api-property-constraint">0.1-0.4</code></span></div><div class="fern-prose prose max-w-none break-words 
text-sm text-(color:--grayscale-a11)"><div data-fern-style="display:contents"><!--$--><p>Diarization threshold to 
apply during speaker diarization. A higher value means there will be a lower chance of one speaker being diarized as 
two different speakers but also a higher chance of two different speakers being diarized as one speaker (less total 
speakers predicted). A low value means there will be a higher chance of one speaker being diarized as two different 
speakers but also a lower chance of two different speakers being diarized as one speaker (more total speakers 
predicted). Can only be set when diarize=True and num_speakers=None. Defaults to None, in which case we will choose a 
threshold based on the model_id (0.22 usually).</p><!--/$--></div></div></div><div data-orientation="horizontal" 
role="none" class="shrink-0 h-px w-full bg-border-default"></div><div 
id="request.body.additional_formats.additional_formats" class="relative m-3 space-y-3 mx-0"><div class="inline-flex 
max-w-full min-w-0 flex-wrap items-center gap-x-2 gap-y-1" data-state="closed"><span 
class="fern-api-property-key">additional_formats</span><span class="fern-api-property-meta" 
data-markdown-ignore=""><span class="fern-api-property-type">list of objects</span><span 
class="fern-api-property-optional">Optional</span></span></div><div class="fern-prose prose max-w-none break-words 
text-sm text-(color:--grayscale-a11)">A list of additional formats to export the transcript to.</div><div 
class="fern-nesting-group" data-fern-style="width:100%"><div data-state="closed" class="fern-nesting-collapse"><button 
tabindex="0" data-state="closed" aria-disabled="false" type="button" aria-controls="radix-:r8Reikld99:" 
aria-expanded="false" class="fern-collapse-trigger text-left fern-nesting-trigger fern-button minimal normal"><span 
class="fern-button-content"><span class="fern-nesting-toggle" aria-hidden="true"><svg 
xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" 
stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus"><path d="M5 
12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span><span class="fern-button-text">Show 6 
variants</span></span></button><div data-state="closed" id="radix-:r8Reikld99:" hidden="" class="fern-collapsible" 
data-skip-animation="true"></div></div></div></div><div data-orientation="horizontal" role="none" class="shrink-0 h-px 
w-full bg-border-default"></div><div id="request.body.file_format.file_format" class="relative m-3 space-y-3 
mx-0"><div class="inline-flex max-w-full min-w-0 flex-wrap items-center gap-x-2 gap-y-1" data-state="closed"><span 
class="fern-api-property-key">file_format</span><span class="fern-api-property-meta" data-markdown-ignore=""><span 
class="fern-api-property-type">enum</span><span class="fern-api-property-optional">Optional</span><span 
class="fern-api-property-default">Defaults to <code>other</code></span></span></div><div class="fern-prose prose 
max-w-none break-words text-sm text-(color:--grayscale-a11)"><div data-fern-style="display:contents"><!--$--><p>The 
format of input audio. Options are ‘pcm_s16le_16’ or ‘other’ For <code>pcm_s16le_16</code>, the input audio must be 
16-bit PCM at a 16kHz sample rate, single channel (mono), and little-endian byte order. Latency will be lower than 
with passing an encoded waveform.</p><!--/$--></div></div><div class="text-(color:--grayscale-a11) flex items-baseline 
gap-2"><span class="shrink-0 text-sm">Allowed values<!-- -->:</span><span class="inline-flex flex-wrap gap-2"><button 
class="fern-docs-badge small grayscale subtle interactive">pcm_s16le_16</button><button class="fern-docs-badge small 
grayscale subtle interactive">other</button></span></div></div><div data-orientation="horizontal" role="none" 
class="shrink-0 h-px w-full bg-border-default"></div><div id="request.body.cloud_storage_url.cloud_storage_url" 
class="relative m-3 space-y-3 mx-0"><div class="inline-flex max-w-full min-w-0 flex-wrap items-center gap-x-2 gap-y-1" 
data-state="closed"><span class="fern-api-property-key">cloud_storage_url</span><span class="fern-api-property-meta" 
data-markdown-ignore=""><span class="fern-api-property-type">string or null</span><span 
class="fern-api-property-optional">Optional</span></span><span data-badge-type="availability" title="Deprecated" 
class="fern-docs-badge small red subtle rounded-full">Deprecated</span></div><div class="fern-prose prose max-w-none 
break-words text-sm text-(color:--grayscale-a11)"><div data-fern-style="display:contents"><!--$--><p>[Deprecated] This 
parameter is deprecated and will be removed in the future. Use ‘source_url’ instead.The HTTPS URL of the file to 
transcribe. Exactly one of the file or cloud_storage_url parameters must be provided. The file must be accessible via 
HTTPS and the file size must be less than 2GB. Any valid HTTPS URL is accepted, including URLs from cloud storage 
providers (AWS S3, Google Cloud Storage, Cloudflare R2, etc.), CDNs, or any other HTTPS source. URLs can be pre-signed 
or include authentication tokens in query parameters.</p><!--/$--></div></div></div><div data-orientation="horizontal" 
role="none" class="shrink-0 h-px w-full bg-border-default"></div><div id="request.body.source_url.source_url" 
class="relative m-3 space-y-3 mx-0"><div class="inline-flex max-w-full min-w-0 flex-wrap items-center gap-x-2 gap-y-1" 
data-state="closed"><span class="fern-api-property-key">source_url</span><span class="fern-api-property-meta" 
data-markdown-ignore=""><span class="fern-api-property-type">string or null</span><span 
class="fern-api-property-optional">Optional</span></span></div><div class="fern-prose prose max-w-none break-words 
text-sm text-(color:--grayscale-a11)">The URL of an audio or video file to transcribe. Supports hosted video or audio 
files, YouTube video URLs, TikTok video URLs, and other video hosting services.</div></div><div 
data-orientation="horizontal" role="none" class="shrink-0 h-px w-full bg-border-default"></div><div 
id="request.body.webhook.webhook" class="relative m-3 space-y-3 mx-0"><div class="inline-flex max-w-full min-w-0 
flex-wrap items-center gap-x-2 gap-y-1" data-state="closed"><span class="fern-api-property-key">webhook</span><span 
class="fern-api-property-meta" data-markdown-ignore=""><span class="fern-api-property-type">boolean</span><span 
class="fern-api-property-optional">Optional</span><span class="fern-api-property-default">Defaults to 
<code>false</code></span></span></div><div class="fern-prose prose max-w-none break-words text-sm 
text-(color:--grayscale-a11)"><div data-fern-style="display:contents"><!--$--><p>Whether to send the transcription 
result to configured speech-to-text webhooks.  If set the request will return early without the transcription, which 
will be delivered later via webhook.</p><!--/$--></div></div></div><div data-orientation="horizontal" role="none" 
class="shrink-0 h-px w-full bg-border-default"></div><div id="request.body.webhook_id.webhook_id" class="relative m-3 
space-y-3 mx-0"><div class="inline-flex max-w-full min-w-0 flex-wrap items-center gap-x-2 gap-y-1" 
data-state="closed"><span class="fern-api-property-key">webhook_id</span><span class="fern-api-property-meta" 
data-markdown-ignore=""><span class="fern-api-property-type">string or null</span><span 
class="fern-api-property-optional">Optional</span></span></div><div class="fern-prose prose max-w-none break-words 
text-sm text-(color:--grayscale-a11)"><div data-fern-style="display:contents"><!--$--><p>Optional specific webhook ID 
to send the transcription result to. Only valid when webhook is set to true. If not provided, transcription will be 
sent to all configured speech-to-text webhooks.</p><!--/$--></div></div></div><div data-orientation="horizontal" 
role="none" class="shrink-0 h-px w-full bg-border-default"></div><div id="request.body.temperature.temperature" 
class="relative m-3 space-y-3 mx-0"><div class="inline-flex max-w-full min-w-0 flex-wrap items-center gap-x-2 gap-y-1" 
data-state="closed"><span class="fern-api-property-key">temperature</span><span class="fern-api-property-meta" 
data-markdown-ignore=""><span class="fern-api-property-type">double or null</span><span 
class="fern-api-property-optional">Optional</span><code 
class="fern-api-property-constraint">0-2</code></span></div><div class="fern-prose prose max-w-none break-words 
text-sm text-(color:--grayscale-a11)">Controls the randomness of the transcription output. Accepts values between 0.0 
and 2.0, where higher values result in more diverse and less deterministic results. If omitted, we will use a 
temperature based on the model you selected which is usually 0.</div></div><div data-orientation="horizontal" 
role="none" class="shrink-0 h-px w-full bg-border-default"></div><div id="request.body.seed.seed" class="relative m-3 
space-y-3 mx-0"><div class="inline-flex max-w-full min-w-0 flex-wrap items-center gap-x-2 gap-y-1" 
data-state="closed"><span class="fern-api-property-key">seed</span><span class="fern-api-property-meta" 
data-markdown-ignore=""><span class="fern-api-property-type">integer or null</span><span 
class="fern-api-property-optional">Optional</span><code 
class="fern-api-property-constraint">0-2147483647</code></span></div><div class="fern-prose prose max-w-none 
break-words text-sm text-(color:--grayscale-a11)">If specified, our system will make a best effort to sample 
deterministically, such that repeated requests with the same seed and parameters should return the same result. 
Determinism is not guaranteed. Must be an integer between 0 and 2147483647.</div></div><div 
data-orientation="horizontal" role="none" class="shrink-0 h-px w-full bg-border-default"></div><div 
id="request.body.use_multi_channel.use_multi_channel" class="relative m-3 space-y-3 mx-0"><div class="inline-flex 
max-w-full min-w-0 flex-wrap items-center gap-x-2 gap-y-1" data-state="closed"><span 
class="fern-api-property-key">use_multi_channel</span><span class="fern-api-property-meta" 
data-markdown-ignore=""><span class="fern-api-property-type">boolean</span><span 
class="fern-api-property-optional">Optional</span><span class="fern-api-property-default">Defaults to 
<code>false</code></span></span></div><div class="fern-prose prose max-w-none break-words text-sm 
text-(color:--grayscale-a11)"><div data-fern-style="display:contents"><!--$--><p>Whether the audio file contains 
multiple channels where each channel contains a single speaker. When enabled, each channel is transcribed 
independently. By default a separate transcript is returned per channel; set multichannel_output_style=‘combined’ to 
instead receive a single transcript with all channels merged and sorted by time. Each word in the response includes a 
‘channel_index’ field indicating which channel it was spoken on. A maximum of 5 channels is supported. Each channel is 
billed independently at the full audio duration, so cost scales linearly with the number of 
channels.</p><!--/$--></div></div></div><div data-orientation="horizontal" role="none" class="shrink-0 h-px w-full 
bg-border-default"></div><div id="request.body.multichannel_output_style.multichannel_output_style" class="relative 
m-3 space-y-3 mx-0"><div class="inline-flex max-w-full min-w-0 flex-wrap items-center gap-x-2 gap-y-1" 
data-state="closed"><span class="fern-api-property-key">multichannel_output_style</span><span 
class="fern-api-property-meta" data-markdown-ignore=""><span class="fern-api-property-type">enum</span><span 
class="fern-api-property-optional">Optional</span><span class="fern-api-property-default">Defaults to 
<code>separate</code></span></span></div><div class="fern-prose prose max-w-none break-words text-sm 
text-(color:--grayscale-a11)"><div data-fern-style="display:contents"><!--$--><p>Controls the response shape when 
use_multi_channel is enabled. ‘separate’ (default) returns one transcript per channel under ‘transcripts’. ‘combined’ 
merges all channels into a single transcript whose words are sorted by start time, each carrying a ‘channel_index’ - 
matching the single-channel response shape. ‘combined’ requires timestamps (timestamps_granularity must not be ‘none’) 
and does not support entity detection or redaction.</p><!--/$--></div></div><div class="text-(color:--grayscale-a11) 
flex items-baseline gap-2"><span class="shrink-0 text-sm">Allowed values<!-- -->:</span><span class="inline-flex 
flex-wrap gap-2"><button class="fern-docs-badge small grayscale subtle interactive">separate</button><button 
class="fern-docs-badge small grayscale subtle interactive">combined</button></span></div></div><div 
data-orientation="horizontal" role="none" class="shrink-0 h-px w-full bg-border-default"></div><div 
id="request.body.webhook_metadata.webhook_metadata" class="relative m-3 space-y-3 mx-0"><div class="inline-flex 
max-w-full min-w-0 flex-wrap items-center gap-x-2 gap-y-1" data-state="closed"><span 
class="fern-api-property-key">webhook_metadata</span><span class="fern-api-property-meta" 
data-markdown-ignore=""><span class="fern-api-property-type">string or map from strings to any or null</span><span 
class="fern-api-property-optional">Optional</span></span></div><div class="fern-prose prose max-w-none break-words 
text-sm text-(color:--grayscale-a11)">Optional metadata to be included in the webhook response. This should be a JSON 
string representing an object with a maximum depth of 2 levels and maximum size of 16KB. Useful for tracking internal 
IDs, job references, or other contextual information.</div><div class="fern-nesting-group" 
data-fern-style="width:100%"><div data-state="closed" class="fern-nesting-collapse"><button tabindex="0" 
data-state="closed" aria-disabled="false" type="button" aria-controls="radix-:r8Rel4ld99:" aria-expanded="false" 
class="fern-collapse-trigger text-left fern-nesting-trigger fern-button minimal normal"><span 
class="fern-button-content"><span class="fern-nesting-toggle" aria-hidden="true"><svg 
xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" 
stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus"><path d="M5 
12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span><span class="fern-button-text">Show 2 
variants</span></span></button><div data-state="closed" id="radix-:r8Rel4ld99:" hidden="" class="fern-collapsible" 
data-skip-animation="true"></div></div></div></div><div data-orientation="horizontal" role="none" class="shrink-0 h-px 
w-full bg-border-default"></div><div id="request.body.entity_detection.entity_detection" class="relative m-3 space-y-3 
mx-0"><div class="inline-flex max-w-full min-w-0 flex-wrap items-center gap-x-2 gap-y-1" data-state="closed"><span 
class="fern-api-property-key">entity_detection</span><span class="fern-api-property-meta" 
data-markdown-ignore=""><span class="fern-api-property-type">string or list of strings or null</span><span 
class="fern-api-property-optional">Optional</span></span></div><div class="fern-prose prose max-w-none break-words 
text-sm text-(color:--grayscale-a11)"><div data-fern-style="display:contents"><!--$--><p>Detect entities in the 
transcript. Can be ‘all’ to detect all entities, a single entity type or category string, or a list of entity 
types/categories. Categories include ‘pii’, ‘phi’, ‘pci’, ‘other’, ‘offensive_language’. When enabled, detected 
entities will be returned in the ‘entities’ field with their text, type, and character 
positions.</p><!--/$--></div></div><div class="fern-nesting-group" data-fern-style="width:100%"><div 
data-state="closed" class="fern-nesting-collapse"><button tabindex="0" data-state="closed" aria-disabled="false" 
type="button" aria-controls="radix-:r8Relcld99:" aria-expanded="false" class="fern-collapse-trigger text-left 
fern-nesting-trigger fern-button minimal normal"><span class="fern-button-content"><span class="fern-nesting-toggle" 
aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" 
stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus"><path 
d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span><span class="fern-button-text">Show 2 
variants</span></span></button><div data-state="closed" id="radix-:r8Relcld99:" hidden="" class="fern-collapsible" 
data-skip-animation="true"></div></div></div></div><div data-orientation="horizontal" role="none" class="shrink-0 h-px 
w-full bg-border-default"></div><div id="request.body.no_verbatim.no_verbatim" class="relative m-3 space-y-3 
mx-0"><div class="inline-flex max-w-full min-w-0 flex-wrap items-center gap-x-2 gap-y-1" data-state="closed"><span 
class="fern-api-property-key">no_verbatim</span><span class="fern-api-property-meta" data-markdown-ignore=""><span 
class="fern-api-property-type">boolean</span><span class="fern-api-property-optional">Optional</span><span 
class="fern-api-property-default">Defaults to <code>false</code></span></span></div><div class="fern-prose prose 
max-w-none break-words text-sm text-(color:--grayscale-a11)"><div data-fern-style="display:contents"><!--$--><p>If 
true, the transcription will not have any filler words, false starts and non-speech sounds. Only supported with 
scribe_v2 model.</p><!--/$--></div></div></div><div data-orientation="horizontal" role="none" class="shrink-0 h-px 
w-full bg-border-default"></div><div id="request.body.use_speaker_library.use_speaker_library" class="relative m-3 
space-y-3 mx-0"><div class="inline-flex max-w-full min-w-0 flex-wrap items-center gap-x-2 gap-y-1" 
data-state="closed"><span class="fern-api-property-key">use_speaker_library</span><span class="fern-api-property-meta" 
data-markdown-ignore=""><span class="fern-api-property-type">boolean</span><span 
class="fern-api-property-optional">Optional</span><span class="fern-api-property-default">Defaults to 
<code>false</code></span></span></div><div class="fern-prose prose max-w-none break-words text-sm 
text-(color:--grayscale-a11)">Whether to use the speaker library for identifying known speakers during diarization. 
When enabled and diarize is true, detected speakers will be matched against registered speakers in the 
workspace&#x27;s speaker library.</div></div><div data-orientation="horizontal" role="none" class="shrink-0 h-px 
w-full bg-border-default"></div><div id="request.body.detect_speaker_roles.detect_speaker_roles" class="relative m-3 
space-y-3 mx-0"><div class="inline-flex max-w-full min-w-0 flex-wrap items-center gap-x-2 gap-y-1" 
data-state="closed"><span class="fern-api-property-key">detect_speaker_roles</span><span 
class="fern-api-property-meta" data-markdown-ignore=""><span class="fern-api-property-type">boolean</span><span 
class="fern-api-property-optional">Optional</span><span class="fern-api-property-default">Defaults to 
<code>false</code></span></span></div><div class="fern-prose prose max-w-none break-words text-sm 
text-(color:--grayscale-a11)"><div data-fern-style="display:contents"><!--$--><p>Whether to detect speaker roles 
(agent vs customer). Requires diarize=true. Cannot be used with use_multi_channel=true. When enabled, speaker_id 
values will be ‘agent’ and ‘customer’ instead of ‘speaker_0’, ‘speaker_1’, etc. Usage incurs an additional 10% 
surcharge on base transcription cost.</p><!--/$--></div></div></div><div data-orientation="horizontal" role="none" 
class="shrink-0 h-px w-full bg-border-default"></div><div id="request.body.entity_redaction.entity_redaction" 
class="relative m-3 space-y-3 mx-0"><div class="inline-flex max-w-full min-w-0 flex-wrap items-center gap-x-2 gap-y-1" 
data-state="closed"><span class="fern-api-property-key">entity_redaction</span><span class="fern-api-property-meta" 
data-markdown-ignore=""><span class="fern-api-property-type">string or list of strings or null</span><span 
class="fern-api-property-optional">Optional</span></span></div><div class="fern-prose prose max-w-none break-words 
text-sm text-(color:--grayscale-a11)"><div data-fern-style="display:contents"><!--$--><p>Redact entities from the 
transcript text. Accepts the same format as entity_detection: ‘all’, a category (‘pii’, ‘phi’), or specific entity 
types. Must be a subset of entity_detection. When redaction is enabled, the entities field will not be 
returned.</p><!--/$--></div></div><div class="fern-nesting-group" data-fern-style="width:100%"><div 
data-state="closed" class="fern-nesting-collapse"><button tabindex="0" data-state="closed" aria-disabled="false" 
type="button" aria-controls="radix-:r8Remcld99:" aria-expanded="false" class="fern-collapse-trigger text-left 
fern-nesting-trigger fern-button minimal normal"><span class="fern-button-content"><span class="fern-nesting-toggle" 
aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" 
stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus"><path 
d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span><span class="fern-button-text">Show 2 
variants</span></span></button><div data-state="closed" id="radix-:r8Remcld99:" hidden="" class="fern-collapsible" 
data-skip-animation="true"></div></div></div></div><div data-orientation="horizontal" role="none" class="shrink-0 h-px 
w-full bg-border-default"></div><div id="request.body.entity_redaction_mode.entity_redaction_mode" class="relative m-3 
space-y-3 mx-0"><div class="inline-flex max-w-full min-w-0 flex-wrap items-center gap-x-2 gap-y-1" 
data-state="closed"><span class="fern-api-property-key">entity_redaction_mode</span><span 
class="fern-api-property-meta" data-markdown-ignore=""><span class="fern-api-property-type">string</span><span 
class="fern-api-property-optional">Optional</span><span class="fern-api-property-default">Defaults to 
<code>enumerated_entity_type</code></span></span></div><div class="fern-prose prose max-w-none break-words text-sm 
text-(color:--grayscale-a11)"><div data-fern-style="display:contents"><!--$--><p>How to format redacted entities. 
‘redacted’ replaces with <!-- -->{REDACTED}<!-- -->, ‘entity_type’ replaces with <!-- -->{ENTITY_TYPE}<!-- -->, 
‘enumerated_entity_type’ replaces with <!-- -->{ENTITY_TYPE_N}<!-- --> where N enumerates each occurrence. Only used 
when entity_redaction is set.</p><!--/$--></div></div></div><div data-orientation="horizontal" role="none" 
class="shrink-0 h-px w-full bg-border-default"></div><div id="request.body.keyterms.keyterms" class="relative m-3 
space-y-3 mx-0"><div class="inline-flex max-w-full min-w-0 flex-wrap items-center gap-x-2 gap-y-1" 
data-state="closed"><span class="fern-api-property-key">keyterms</span><span class="fern-api-property-meta" 
data-markdown-ignore=""><span class="fern-api-property-type">list of strings</span><span 
class="fern-api-property-optional">Optional</span><span class="fern-api-property-default">Defaults to 
<code>[]</code></span></span></div><div class="fern-prose prose max-w-none break-words text-sm 
text-(color:--grayscale-a11)"><div data-fern-style="display:contents"><!--$--><p>A list of keyterms to bias the 
transcription towards.           The keyterms are words or phrases you want the model to recognise more accurately.    
       The number of keyterms cannot exceed 1000.           The length of each keyterm must be less than 50 
characters.           Keyterms can contain at most 5 words (after normalisation).           For example [“hello”, 
“world”, “technical term”].           The following characters are not supported: <code>&lt;</code>, 
<code>&gt;</code>, <code>{</code>, <code>}</code>, <code>[</code>, <code>]</code>, <code>\</code>.           Usage of 
this parameter will incur an additional 20% surcharge on the base transcription cost.           When more than 100 
keyterms are provided, a minimum billable duration of 20 seconds applies per 
request.</p><!--/$--></div></div></div></div><div id="response" class="relative space-y-3 
